## Summary
This article explores the paradigm shift toward remote working that began before the COVID-19 pandemic and highlights data protection concerns under local and national directives. It is sourced from GDPR.eu, focusing on GDPR compliance for remote work environments.

## Key Points
- Remote working trend accelerated due to the COVID-19 pandemic.
- Data protection is essential with directives confining populations.
- GDPR.eu offers guidance on maintaining data security while working remotely.
- Compliance with GDPR is a key consideration for remote work setups.


